HOW TO READ THE DISCRIMINATOR:
  RAW=[<path>]                   -> it expanded; the path IS the answer (per-plugin or not)
  RAW=[]  with ENV_PRESENT=[1]   -> the variable EXISTS but is EMPTY  (silent no-op under '|| true')
